\pard\nowidctlpar\li284\sl276\slmult1\fs21 I spent two months at the School of Public Health in London, working closely with my supervisors and the Imperial College malaria modeling team. During this time, I gained an in-depth understanding of the deterministic malaria model used at Imperial College. This experience allowed me to develop my skills in disease modeling, public health research, and collaborative scientific work.\par\pard\nowidctlpar\sl240\slmult1\tqr\tx9088\fs21 
